{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>שלוחה</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the other two: נפתלי אילה שלוחה (Naphtali is a hind let loose), והנה יד שלוחה (and behold, a hand was sent forth). Regarding Daniel — the meaning is: just as there they say שפר (favor), so too here, by means of the gift he found favor and honor, and he said to him: 'It is a gift sent to my lord, to Esau' — so said your servant Jacob. And just as there it is יד שלוחה, so too here: even though he did not wish in his mouth to accept it, behold, his hand is sent forth to accept it."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:34.908917993Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}